    "text": "Mole fraction of toluene vapour <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msubsup><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msubsup><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msubsup><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo></math> Mole fraction of toluene in solution =2/4 = 0.5<br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo></math> Mole fraction of benzene = 2/4 = 0.5<br /><br /><math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo></math> Vapour pressure of pure toluene = 80 mm<br /><br /><math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo></math> Vapour pressure of benzene = 120 mm<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>80</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>120</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0.40</mn></math>",
